---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Taylor Bornstein — content and communications director, based in Fredericksburg, VA, remote.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 pb-24 pt-16 sm:px-10 sm:pt-24">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl font-display text-4xl text-ink sm:text-5xl">Taylor Bornstein</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl font-display text-xl italic text-muted">
      I write. I manage writers. I plan and execute great content. I love the Oxford comma as
      much as I do not love snakes.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-12 sm:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr]">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-prose prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-ink">
        <p>
          I'm a content and communications leader — director level, with over a decade shaping
          how technology brands talk to developers, engineering managers, and executives at once.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most people in this seat can do editorial craft or pipeline attribution. Fewer have run
          both. I build the systems — editorial infrastructure, AI tooling, measurement, and
          teams — that let technical companies say something worth reading, consistently. That
          means I'm as comfortable drafting the sentence myself as I am standing up the
          editorial calendar, the tone-of-voice guidelines, and the AI-powered tool stack that
          lets a team ship good writing without me in the room.
        </p>
        <h2>What I do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Content strategy &amp; editorial direction</li>
          <li>Public relations &amp; earned media programs</li>
          <li>Brand voice, editorial guidelines &amp; style systems</li>
          <li>Content team building &amp; management</li>
          <li>AI tooling for content and editorial workflows</li>
          <li>Measurement — PR metrics, GEO/AEO, and attribution for editorial work</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="text-sm text-muted">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg text-ink">Currently</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink">Content and Communications Director, Bolt.new</p>
        <p class="mt-1">Remote &middot; Feb 2026 &ndash; present</p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg text-ink">Previously</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-3">
          <li>
            <p class="text-ink">Director of Content Marketing &amp; PR, Mendix</p>
            <p>2019 &ndash; 2026</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="text-ink">Marketing Copywriter, Iron Mountain</p>
            <p>2015 &ndash; 2019</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p class="text-ink">Content Editor &amp; Manager, Internet Brands</p>
            <p>2009 &ndash; 2014</p>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg text-ink">Education</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">MA in Writing, University of Warwick</p>
        <p class="mt-1">BA in English &amp; Spanish, University of Vermont (cum laude)</p>

        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-accent"
        >
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
